## VPN Endpoints

| Parameter | HQ Side | Branch Side |
|---|---|---|
| Tunnel name | `HQ-to-BR1` | `BR1-to-HQ` |
| Local peer IP | 100.65.0.101 (port2 / WAN1) | 100.65.1.111 (port2 / WAN1) |
| Remote peer IP | 100.65.1.111 | 100.65.0.101 |
| Protected subnet | 10.0.11.0/24 | 172.20.1.0/24 |

> Note: the IPsec tunnel is bound only to WAN1 (`port2`) at each site — it is not part of the HQ SD-WAN zone. See the [HQ SD-WAN (Bonus)](../README.md#hq-sd-wan-bonus) section in the main README for the failover scope note.

